1
00:00:05,989 --> 00:00:09,593
Heiwa Fansubs Presents:
"Great Detective Conan"
"Challenge to Kudo Shin'ichi"

2
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:16,066
Whaa! Ouch!

3
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:20,737
Oh no, it's gotten even more painful.

4
00:00:21,004 --> 00:00:26,009
Say, if we go on like this,
will we be electrocuted?

5
00:00:34,217 --> 00:00:35,852
I see...

6
00:00:35,952 --> 00:00:38,121
It's easy to figure out with this hint.

7
00:00:38,188 --> 00:00:39,322
Eh?

8
00:00:39,556 --> 00:00:43,593
That case where you made
that spectacular fuss.

9
00:00:50,801 --> 00:00:54,137
"September 30th, 2010"

10
00:00:54,237 --> 00:00:59,309
"Next stop, Beika 3-Chome,
next stop is Beika 3-Chome."

11
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:01,144
"Bus Stop
Beika 3-Chome"

12
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:06,917
Hmm... this is cute.

13
00:01:06,983 --> 00:01:08,952
Ah, Shin'ichi, isn't this cute?

14
00:01:09,052 --> 00:01:10,954
- Umm...
- Cute, isn't it?

15
00:01:14,324 --> 00:01:15,692
Kyaa!

16
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,527
Hey!

17
00:01:21,765 --> 00:01:23,066
What's up?

18
00:01:23,133 --> 00:01:24,401
"Shin'ichi's Childhood Friend
Mori Ran"

19
00:01:24,468 --> 00:01:29,206
A mo... mo... molester!
That guy's a molester!

20
00:01:29,306 --> 00:01:31,007
Eh?!

21
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:34,611
"High School Student Detective
Kudo Shin'ichi"

22
00:01:34,678 --> 00:01:38,348
Hey, someone! Please catch that person!

23
00:01:44,621 --> 00:01:46,289
Wait!

24
00:01:46,890 --> 00:01:49,960
He's running away! Wait!

25
00:01:50,427 --> 00:01:51,828
Wait!

26
00:01:51,895 --> 00:01:54,097
Ran, wait up!

27
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,001
Eh?

28
00:01:59,035 --> 00:02:00,904
Where did he go?

29
00:02:02,572 --> 00:02:04,241
He's gone.

30
00:02:04,407 --> 00:02:06,176
He disappeared...

31
00:02:07,377 --> 00:02:08,912
Shin'ichi, over here!

32
00:02:09,713 --> 00:02:11,148
Wait, you rascal!

33
00:02:11,248 --> 00:02:12,582
So persistent!

34
00:02:12,682 --> 00:02:14,784
Wait, I said!

35
00:02:19,022 --> 00:02:20,957
Wait!

36
00:02:21,324 --> 00:02:23,460
Hold up, you molester!

37
00:02:24,528 --> 00:02:26,029
Ala?

38
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,667
He's disappeared again.

39
00:02:33,537 --> 00:02:36,206
Ah, he's there!

40
00:02:36,873 --> 00:02:38,708
You...

41
00:02:41,178 --> 00:02:42,779
Wait!

42
00:02:46,383 --> 00:02:50,086
That molester knows his way
around here too well!

43
00:02:50,554 --> 00:02:52,789
Ran! Drive him to your left!

44
00:02:52,889 --> 00:02:54,658
- Eh?!
- Leave this to me.

45
00:02:54,758 --> 00:02:56,660
Yes!

46
00:03:00,897 --> 00:03:02,532
Ah!

47
00:03:08,071 --> 00:03:09,940
Wait!

48
00:03:16,813 --> 00:03:20,050
Give it up. There's no escape.

49
00:03:22,285 --> 00:03:26,556
I just can't forgive someone for touching
a person's butt and then running away!

50
00:03:27,757 --> 00:03:29,192
That's dangerous!

51
00:03:33,029 --> 00:03:34,998
You should've known better, Molester-san!

52
00:03:41,338 --> 00:03:44,641
Give up, you molester!

53
00:03:45,542 --> 00:03:48,778
Because I'm the only one
who can touch Ran.

54
00:03:49,412 --> 00:03:51,081
What did you say?!

55
00:03:51,248 --> 00:03:53,250
No, nothing.

56
00:03:56,586 --> 00:03:59,656
"Molester - Sawada Osamu"
I'm sorry. Please overlook it this once.

57
00:03:59,789 --> 00:04:00,924
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

58
00:04:00,991 --> 00:04:03,526
Doesn't look like anything's broken, Mister.

59
00:04:04,094 --> 00:04:06,630
Ah, excuse me, here too?

60
00:04:08,031 --> 00:04:10,367
This is a burn, isn't it?

61
00:04:10,533 --> 00:04:12,769
Count himself lucky; he got off easy.

62
00:04:12,869 --> 00:04:15,872
Point is, you're being too soft on him!

63
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:22,212
Now, let's go to the police. Got that?

64
00:04:22,312 --> 00:04:24,614
Ah, I'm sorry!
I won't touch you anymore!

65
00:04:24,681 --> 00:04:26,683
No good! I definitely won't forgive you.

66
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:29,152
Please give me a break and not the police.

67
00:04:29,252 --> 00:04:32,088
Give it up. She's a bad person.

68
00:04:32,222 --> 00:04:33,623
Shin'ichi!

69
00:04:33,823 --> 00:04:34,791
Let's go!

70
00:04:34,858 --> 00:04:36,192
Get going!

71
00:04:36,359 --> 00:04:37,394
Roger.

72
00:04:37,494 --> 00:04:39,996
Now! Get walking!

73
00:04:41,464 --> 00:04:44,501
Ah, excuse me, Policeman-san!

74
00:04:50,974 --> 00:04:53,176
Miyano-san. Hang in there!

75
00:04:53,243 --> 00:04:55,178
We'll take you to the hospital right away!

76
00:04:58,948 --> 00:05:00,483
You're Yamashita-san, aren't you?

77
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:01,651
"MPD Investigation Unit One
Sato Miwako"

78
00:05:01,685 --> 00:05:03,653
I'll ask you to remain here.

79
00:05:03,753 --> 00:05:06,022
What is it?! I haven't done anything.

80
00:05:06,089 --> 00:05:08,024
I want to hear details of
the circumstances.

81
00:05:10,193 --> 00:05:12,562
"MPD Investigation Unit One
Takagi Wataru"

82
00:05:12,662 --> 00:05:15,732
Kudo-kun, Ran-san... what's going on?

83
00:05:15,865 --> 00:05:18,234
This person's a molester!
Please arrest him.

84
00:05:18,301 --> 00:05:19,803
Molester!? Come with me!

85
00:05:19,836 --> 00:05:22,038
Ah, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
It was on impulse...

86
00:05:22,138 --> 00:05:23,907
Tell me.
Who did you molest?

87
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,442
Ah, this person.

88
00:05:25,542 --> 00:05:27,510
You picked... the wrong one, didn't you?

89
00:05:27,577 --> 00:05:30,080
Takagi! Do your job!

90
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:32,682
Detective Sato, do you have a case?

91
00:05:32,816 --> 00:05:33,983
Kudo-kun.

92
00:05:34,084 --> 00:05:35,985
Yeah, bit of a one.

93
00:05:36,086 --> 00:05:39,956
This Helper, Yamoshita Makoto-san,
had gone out shopping...

94
00:05:40,023 --> 00:05:45,695
...when the artificial respirator maintaining
Miyano Katsuyo-san's respiration suddenly stopped.

95
00:05:45,962 --> 00:05:48,732
With that, Katsuyo-san went into
cardiopulmonary arrest...

96
00:05:48,732 --> 00:05:50,767
...and she's being taken to
the hospital in an ambulance.

97
00:05:50,900 --> 00:05:52,936
Her respirator stopped?

98
00:05:53,103 --> 00:05:56,906
The circuit breaker had failed once before,
but even if this is a similar incident...

99
00:05:57,006 --> 00:06:00,643
Are you saying I wanted to kill Miyano-san?

100
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:04,247
When her respirator stopped,
no one was in the room with her.

101
00:06:04,381 --> 00:06:09,686
If it hadn't contacted the hospital with
an alarm, Katsuyo-san could have died.

102
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:15,158
In short, I can't deny the possibility
that someone prepared this as a murder.

103
00:06:15,825 --> 00:06:18,995
Would it be okay if I
took a little look around?

104
00:06:20,163 --> 00:06:24,567
I'm sorry.
It was... just so cute...

105
00:06:25,368 --> 00:06:28,104
Even if it is cute...

106
00:06:28,605 --> 00:06:30,273
Come in.

107
00:06:36,346 --> 00:06:38,782
Touching my butt is a crime!

108
00:06:38,882 --> 00:06:42,752
In criminal law,
this sort of thing is the worst...

109
00:06:42,819 --> 00:06:44,954
...and, yeah, you could even spend
a year or whatever in prison.

110
00:06:45,054 --> 00:06:47,657
Moreover, there's the shock it gives
to the women victims!

111
00:06:47,757 --> 00:06:51,094
There've been cases where they can't even
ride buses or trains anymore, you know!

112
00:06:51,161 --> 00:06:53,430
If I end up like that...

113
00:06:53,563 --> 00:06:54,898
...it'll have been your fault!

114
00:06:54,964 --> 00:06:57,967
Detective. Are you okay dealing with me
rather than that case over there?

115
00:06:58,034 --> 00:06:59,135
Thank you.

116
00:06:59,202 --> 00:07:02,439
Since the person himself seems to regret it
and didn't do anything worse...

117
00:07:02,605 --> 00:07:04,607
We'll have him write a letter of apology
at the police station.

118
00:07:04,674 --> 00:07:05,875
Huh?

119
00:07:06,209 --> 00:07:07,577
So half-assed!

120
00:07:07,710 --> 00:07:10,447
I don't feel like giving up my complaint!

121
00:07:10,547 --> 00:07:12,148
Excuse me.

122
00:07:13,917 --> 00:07:15,518
Yes, this is Takagi.

123
00:07:15,618 --> 00:07:17,887
Yes. Eh?

124
00:07:18,054 --> 00:07:20,490
Sawada Osamu has a criminal record?!

125
00:07:24,561 --> 00:07:29,566
Katsuyo-san was the victim of a traffic accident
several years ago while out walking.

126
00:07:29,766 --> 00:07:31,701
After that she had a stroke.

127
00:07:31,835 --> 00:07:35,672
Since her only immediate family, her daughter
Yukari-san, is too busy working to nurse her...

128
00:07:35,905 --> 00:07:40,810
...they seem to have gotten Yamashita-san
as her Helper to care for her.

129
00:07:41,344 --> 00:07:45,715
Recently she's been unconscious
and not even able to breathe for herself.

130
00:07:45,815 --> 00:07:52,255
Even so, this artificial respirator
should have had a battery for emergencies.

131
00:07:52,388 --> 00:07:54,424
So why isn't there a battery!?

132
00:07:54,524 --> 00:07:57,260
The battery broke down and is being repaired.

133
00:07:57,327 --> 00:07:58,761
What do you mean?

134
00:07:58,928 --> 00:08:01,698
That could cause a
life-threatening problem, couldn't it?

135
00:08:02,799 --> 00:08:05,134
Do you know what caused
the circuit breaker on it to fail?

136
00:08:05,368 --> 00:08:07,136
I'm waiting for
the criminal investigation into that.

137
00:08:07,303 --> 00:08:09,305
Even though I appear as a Helper...

138
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:11,808
...my salary is for being Miyano-san's nurse.

139
00:08:11,941 --> 00:08:14,277
Why would you say I'd kill my own employer for?

140
00:08:14,377 --> 00:08:17,347
I caught him sneaking into here.

141
00:08:22,552 --> 00:08:25,154
While he was here, I bet he was peeping.

142
00:08:25,255 --> 00:08:27,891
Anyhow, his criminal record
is for peeping, isn't it?

143
00:08:27,957 --> 00:08:31,194
- Is that so, Sawada?
- My game isn't in peeping.

144
00:08:31,494 --> 00:08:33,096
Then just what is your game?

145
00:08:33,196 --> 00:08:34,030
That's...

146
00:08:34,097 --> 00:08:36,699
And after that, where did he run off to?

147
00:08:36,833 --> 00:08:38,401
Over here.

148
00:08:40,036 --> 00:08:42,105
A security camera...

149
00:08:44,841 --> 00:08:46,743
Why is that broken?

150
00:08:46,843 --> 00:08:50,513
It seems Yukari-san was having her
underwear stolen, so she put that up...

151
00:08:50,613 --> 00:08:53,516
...but she said it's been broken a long time now.

152
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:56,686
Ehh... So things like this are
the most recent style, huh...

153
00:08:56,819 --> 00:08:58,254
These are pretty, too.

154
00:08:58,288 --> 00:09:00,890
Hey, which ones would
high school students be interested in?

155
00:09:01,024 --> 00:09:04,460
Eh... Wha... what would interest them...

156
00:09:13,002 --> 00:09:15,271
Hey, wait. What are you doing
so suddenly, Kudo-kun?

157
00:09:15,305 --> 00:09:17,206
No, it's not like that.

158
00:09:17,273 --> 00:09:19,609
What sort of underwear
do you wear, Detective Sato?

159
00:09:19,676 --> 00:09:20,710
Eh?!

160
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:22,478
Do you have lots of black ones?

161
00:09:22,545 --> 00:09:24,847
Hmm... I do like black...

162
00:09:25,048 --> 00:09:27,350
- Hey!
- Is that right.

163
00:09:28,985 --> 00:09:31,888
Ran-chan! Do something about Kudo-kun!

164
00:09:31,955 --> 00:09:34,457
I don't have time right now for Shin'ichi,
so if you would please.

165
00:09:34,524 --> 00:09:35,458
This way.

166
00:09:35,558 --> 00:09:38,962
Like I thought, do underwear thieves
prefer panties over bras?

167
00:09:39,062 --> 00:09:40,797
Hmm, I guess so...

168
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,732
I wouldn't know such a thing!

169
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:46,569
Ask an underwear thief
directly yourself! Geez!

170
00:09:53,843 --> 00:09:55,812
This is...

171
00:10:16,165 --> 00:10:18,067
Mom...

172
00:10:18,635 --> 00:10:20,336
Yukari-san!

173
00:10:27,110 --> 00:10:29,145
Yukari-san, are you okay?

174
00:10:29,245 --> 00:10:30,680
Where's Mom?

175
00:10:30,747 --> 00:10:33,783
She was taken by ambulance
to the hospital a little while ago...

176
00:10:34,484 --> 00:10:37,687
I'm sorry. If I had been back in time,
this wouldn't have happened.

177
00:10:37,754 --> 00:10:38,755
"Katsuyo's daughter
Miyano Yukari"

178
00:10:38,788 --> 00:10:40,757
Will she be saved?

179
00:10:41,124 --> 00:10:42,892
I'm sure she will...

180
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,928
Anyhow, let's hurry to the hospital.

181
00:10:47,196 --> 00:10:48,865
Excuse me.

182
00:10:49,065 --> 00:10:51,601
I'm Sato of MPD Investigation Unit One.

183
00:10:51,701 --> 00:10:53,770
You're Miyano Yukari-san, aren't you?

184
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:56,205
Has your underwear been stolen often?

185
00:10:56,339 --> 00:10:58,841
Kudo-kun, what are you talking about?!

186
00:10:59,375 --> 00:11:01,210
It often was before...

187
00:11:01,310 --> 00:11:03,913
But not so much recently.

188
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,683
Kudo-kun, stay around here.
We'll be going to the hospital now.

189
00:11:06,716 --> 00:11:08,251
After one more question.

190
00:11:08,317 --> 00:11:11,254
How long has that security camera been broken?

191
00:11:13,823 --> 00:11:17,260
6 months ago since the rains.
The camera seems to have short-circuited.

192
00:11:17,427 --> 00:11:20,029
Was that linked to
the previous respirator incident?

193
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:22,965
If that was the cause before...

194
00:11:23,299 --> 00:11:25,401
...is the camera the cause
this time around, too?

195
00:11:25,468 --> 00:11:27,003
Put an end to this!

196
00:11:27,103 --> 00:11:31,340
This is a matter of whether her mother
will live or die. What good does that do us!?

197
00:11:37,346 --> 00:11:38,915
Ah, please wait!

198
00:11:39,015 --> 00:11:42,652
I need a little of your time to hear
what you have to say.

199
00:11:44,654 --> 00:11:47,457
Kudo-kun, you're being strange today.

200
00:11:47,924 --> 00:11:49,826
That's true.

201
00:11:50,226 --> 00:11:52,628
I may not seem to be me.

202
00:12:06,676 --> 00:12:09,579
I understand the trick behind this case.

203
00:12:10,747 --> 00:12:12,648
Still...

204
00:12:12,915 --> 00:12:15,818
...who on earth is the criminal?

205
00:12:20,156 --> 00:12:21,357
"Repeat Offender"

206
00:12:23,493 --> 00:12:26,362
I guess this guy is a repeat offender.

207
00:12:26,496 --> 00:12:27,864
That's right!

208
00:12:27,897 --> 00:12:30,767
It was just like I thought.

209
00:12:30,867 --> 00:12:35,238
But even so, Detective Takagi
didn't believe me at all!

210
00:12:35,338 --> 00:12:37,807
At all? You apologize properly, too!

211
00:12:37,907 --> 00:12:41,277
But I intend to live responsibly from here on.

212
00:12:41,511 --> 00:12:43,079
You can't just rehabilitate like that
on your own!

213
00:12:43,146 --> 00:12:44,614
I won't allow it!

214
00:12:44,714 --> 00:12:47,316
Now, now Ran-chan, calm down.

215
00:12:48,484 --> 00:12:51,587
Hey! Are you really repenting?

216
00:12:51,687 --> 00:12:54,457
You haven't listened to a word
I've said since earlier!

217
00:12:54,590 --> 00:12:56,459
That's not true...

218
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:59,996
Shin'ichi!
Say something!

219
00:13:00,263 --> 00:13:01,664
Please take it out.

220
00:13:01,764 --> 00:13:03,166
Huh?

221
00:13:04,133 --> 00:13:06,702
The underwear you've stolen.

222
00:13:07,436 --> 00:13:09,972
I guess it's no good if I don't bring them out?

223
00:13:10,072 --> 00:13:12,642
Eh?! Underwear?

224
00:13:20,750 --> 00:13:22,485
Like I thought, they are black.

225
00:13:22,552 --> 00:13:23,786
Eh?

226
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,788
Black is best, isn't it?

227
00:13:26,122 --> 00:13:28,624
Ah, well, black is the best...

228
00:13:28,691 --> 00:13:29,492
Shin'ichi!

229
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:31,227
Do you always take black?

230
00:13:31,394 --> 00:13:35,198
Well... I do love them.

231
00:13:36,666 --> 00:13:39,669
Hey! Don't just exchange opinions
on stuff like that!

232
00:13:39,836 --> 00:13:43,239
Fool! This is important.

233
00:13:43,406 --> 00:13:46,242
You're saying the color of underwear
is what's important?

234
00:13:46,375 --> 00:13:47,977
Well, that's...

235
00:13:48,044 --> 00:13:49,645
Shin'ichi...

236
00:13:49,779 --> 00:13:53,115
Shin'ichi, don't you feel even a little sorry
about me being molested?

237
00:13:53,182 --> 00:13:55,418
No, it has nothing to do with that.

238
00:13:55,451 --> 00:13:58,588
You aren't even the least bit
worried about me!

239
00:13:58,688 --> 00:14:00,423
I am worried!

240
00:14:00,556 --> 00:14:03,526
Don't cry over a thing like that!

241
00:14:04,794 --> 00:14:06,896
You aren't nice!

242
00:14:12,001 --> 00:14:13,703
- Eh?!
- Eh?!

243
00:14:14,003 --> 00:14:16,239
That's property damage!

244
00:14:17,073 --> 00:14:20,509
Anyhow, I won't let you get away with this!

245
00:14:20,576 --> 00:14:22,511
Yes, yes, yes.

246
00:14:22,545 --> 00:14:25,381
Um... Can I borrow Sawada-san
for just a little while?

247
00:14:25,481 --> 00:14:27,383
Go ahead, go ahead.

248
00:14:29,418 --> 00:14:34,624
There's a lot of underwear being dried
around here, so why did you take this one?

249
00:14:34,690 --> 00:14:36,559
Because I like black.

250
00:14:36,659 --> 00:14:37,860
There is other underwear.

251
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:41,097
Hmm... I guess, how do I put it,
it's just about the color.

252
00:14:41,197 --> 00:14:43,366
Ehh...

253
00:14:45,701 --> 00:14:48,337
Do you know this woman?

254
00:14:49,772 --> 00:14:51,440
How about it?

255
00:14:53,542 --> 00:14:57,113
If you don't tell us,
you'll be charged with murder.

256
00:14:57,346 --> 00:14:58,581
Mu... murder?!

257
00:14:58,648 --> 00:14:59,815
Murder?!

258
00:14:59,916 --> 00:15:01,117
Murder?!

259
00:15:03,185 --> 00:15:05,087
Wait, lemme see that!

260
00:15:06,322 --> 00:15:07,657
What is this about, Kudo-kun?

261
00:15:07,723 --> 00:15:09,392
How about it, Sawada-san?

262
00:15:09,458 --> 00:15:11,193
I know her.

263
00:15:11,961 --> 00:15:14,230
I figured.

264
00:15:14,835 --> 00:15:17,530
You've stolen from her before.

265
00:15:35,451 --> 00:15:38,387
"Caught you at last, you rascal!
I'm calling the police!"

266
00:15:38,421 --> 00:15:40,656
"I'm sorry. I'm sorry, it was just an impulse."

267
00:15:40,723 --> 00:15:42,658
"I'm very sorry!"

268
00:15:43,592 --> 00:15:45,728
"Do you like black?"

269
00:15:46,228 --> 00:15:48,597
"The only ones that have
disappeared were black."

270
00:15:48,731 --> 00:15:50,333
"I'm sorry."

271
00:15:53,102 --> 00:15:54,637
"Do you have a girlfriend?"

272
00:15:54,737 --> 00:15:56,372
"Yes."

273
00:15:56,706 --> 00:15:59,241
"Then have her make or buy them for you."

274
00:15:59,575 --> 00:16:01,844
"Don't go taking them anymore, got that?"

275
00:16:02,078 --> 00:16:03,679
"Thank you very much."

276
00:16:03,779 --> 00:16:05,915
"Wait, Yukari-san. This is..."

277
00:16:05,982 --> 00:16:09,919
"Because you're here, we can let
various people off like this, can't we?"

278
00:16:10,586 --> 00:16:12,488
"So it's okay, isn't it?"

279
00:16:12,588 --> 00:16:14,757
"Thank you very much."

280
00:16:16,258 --> 00:16:18,194
I don't believe you!

281
00:16:18,294 --> 00:16:20,129
What are you gonna do, Detective Sato?

282
00:16:20,196 --> 00:16:21,831
Well, everyone's different.

283
00:16:21,931 --> 00:16:23,132
Different!?

284
00:16:23,199 --> 00:16:24,800
Thank you very much.

285
00:16:24,967 --> 00:16:27,937
Wait a minute, Kudo-kun.
What on earth is this about?

286
00:16:28,771 --> 00:16:30,740
Sawada-san is a thief...

287
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:32,441
A repeat underwear thief.

288
00:16:32,541 --> 00:16:35,411
Is he a murderer?

289
00:16:35,578 --> 00:16:36,746
In some ways.

290
00:16:36,846 --> 00:16:38,280
Oi, oi, oi, hang on there!

291
00:16:38,347 --> 00:16:39,315
I don't understand what you mean.

292
00:16:39,415 --> 00:16:41,717
Shin'ichi! Explain yourself properly!

293
00:16:41,851 --> 00:16:45,187
Whichever it is,
you'll arrest Sawada-san, won't you?

294
00:16:45,621 --> 00:16:47,456
That's true.

295
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:50,760
However, molesting and murder...

296
00:16:50,826 --> 00:16:52,361
What's the difference?

297
00:16:52,395 --> 00:16:54,030
Well...

298
00:16:56,265 --> 00:16:58,534
Explain it to me properly.

299
00:16:59,235 --> 00:17:03,372
Then, could you call the hospital
and ask them?

300
00:17:03,506 --> 00:17:05,674
What condition Miyano-san's mother is in.

301
00:17:05,808 --> 00:17:08,277
And how is that related to this?

302
00:17:09,111 --> 00:17:11,447
There's just one truth.

303
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,215
However...

304
00:17:13,349 --> 00:17:18,487
Just the truth doesn't make justice.

305
00:17:19,889 --> 00:17:22,358
Until I find out, I can't tell you.

306
00:17:24,326 --> 00:17:26,095
All right.

307
00:17:30,399 --> 00:17:33,702
This is Sato of the MPD Investigation Unit One.

308
00:17:33,769 --> 00:17:36,872
The ambulance you accepted a little while ago...

309
00:17:40,743 --> 00:17:42,311
Miyano-san, can you understand me?

310
00:17:42,344 --> 00:17:43,679
Blood pressure at 120 over 80.

311
00:17:43,946 --> 00:17:45,681
Please check the x-ray.

312
00:17:45,781 --> 00:17:47,683
Her test results are in. If you would please.

313
00:17:55,791 --> 00:18:00,229
Miyano-san, I need to talk to you.

314
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,309
"Beika General Hospital"

315
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:23,519
You noticed, didn't you?

316
00:18:23,719 --> 00:18:25,221
Yes.

317
00:18:26,288 --> 00:18:28,891
Then why did you keep quiet about it?

318
00:18:29,125 --> 00:18:32,495
Because truth and justice
aren't necessarily the same.

319
00:18:33,562 --> 00:18:37,666
Please tell me in detail about her
previous respiratory accident.

320
00:18:41,637 --> 00:18:43,939
It was a day of heavy rains.

321
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:47,042
Apparently as the rain struck it...

322
00:18:47,243 --> 00:18:49,245
...that caused a short-circuit
and the circuit breaker to flip.

323
00:18:50,913 --> 00:18:54,650
Without electricity,
her artificial respirator would stop.

324
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:59,188
And when it stopped, my mother would die.

325
00:19:00,022 --> 00:19:04,560
At that time I called an electrician's store
and the fire department...

326
00:19:04,627 --> 00:19:07,096
...and somehow got by.

327
00:19:08,664 --> 00:19:11,467
The emergency battery had failed, huh?

328
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:14,970
I had ordered a new one for it, but it hadn't...

329
00:19:15,137 --> 00:19:18,574
You've already been nursing her
for quite a long time, haven't you?

330
00:19:19,041 --> 00:19:21,143
Since the traffic accident...

331
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:23,579
It's been 7 years.

332
00:19:24,046 --> 00:19:27,116
It's been very tough on you, hasn't it?

333
00:19:27,983 --> 00:19:30,653
Mom and I didn't get along...

334
00:19:30,786 --> 00:19:34,256
...so when she could still talk,
she told me this.

335
00:19:34,390 --> 00:19:37,226
"I'm just so much baggage, aren't I?" she said.

336
00:19:37,326 --> 00:19:40,362
"Marry whoever you want!"

337
00:19:41,096 --> 00:19:45,834
There was someone who had
promised to marry me.

338
00:19:47,436 --> 00:19:49,605
But...

339
00:19:50,272 --> 00:19:52,474
I couldn't choose him...

340
00:19:52,641 --> 00:19:54,643
That short-circuit in the electricity.

341
00:19:54,877 --> 00:19:57,846
That's what gave you the hint, wasn't it?

342
00:19:58,647 --> 00:20:00,516
That's true.

343
00:20:02,551 --> 00:20:04,520
If it hadn't been for that...

344
00:20:04,753 --> 00:20:07,089
...this wouldn't have happened.

345
00:20:07,756 --> 00:20:09,592
That day...

346
00:20:09,925 --> 00:20:14,697
...a sudden and dreadful idea
popped into my head.

347
00:20:16,665 --> 00:20:18,801
Just like this...

348
00:20:19,468 --> 00:20:22,438
If the electricity doesn't
come back on just like this...

349
00:20:23,305 --> 00:20:27,109
...I could run away from the pain
of nursing her, I thought.

350
00:20:30,045 --> 00:20:33,549
But you didn't do that.

351
00:20:34,850 --> 00:20:37,052
That was impossible for me.

352
00:20:37,953 --> 00:20:40,122
To allow my mother to die.

353
00:20:40,289 --> 00:20:43,759
And that was when you met that underwear thief.

354
00:20:46,328 --> 00:20:48,197
You couldn't do it yourself.

355
00:20:48,264 --> 00:20:50,633
However, by taking advantage of
that man's habit...

356
00:20:50,766 --> 00:20:55,738
...then on some unknown day,
you put that switch in.

357
00:20:56,171 --> 00:20:57,873
"I'm very sorry!"

358
00:20:58,307 --> 00:21:00,175
"Do you like black?"

359
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:04,146
"The only ones that have disappeared were black."

360
00:21:04,413 --> 00:21:06,148
"I'm sorry."

361
00:21:08,050 --> 00:21:11,320
Pulling the power cord from
the security camera...

362
00:21:11,620 --> 00:21:14,690
...you attached both electrodes
to a clothespin...

363
00:21:14,990 --> 00:21:18,961
...and then hung a pair of black underwear
between each of the electrodes.

364
00:21:19,495 --> 00:21:22,064
You then took a black thread
you had sewn into the underwear...

365
00:21:22,331 --> 00:21:25,534
...and extended it to
the security camera's power cord.

366
00:21:25,968 --> 00:21:28,404
At the moment the thief stole the underwear...

367
00:21:28,637 --> 00:21:32,808
...the clothespin and power cord
would become detached, causing a short.

368
00:21:42,184 --> 00:21:44,953
When you returned each day...

369
00:21:45,354 --> 00:21:49,525
...you would invariably check to see if
the black underwear was there or not.

370
00:21:51,694 --> 00:21:53,862
That man...

371
00:21:54,496 --> 00:21:57,800
...who loved black underwear so much...

372
00:21:58,934 --> 00:22:01,637
...would steal the underwear...

373
00:22:03,238 --> 00:22:05,974
...and thus end your mother's life...

374
00:22:15,351 --> 00:22:17,419
"Wait, molester!"

375
00:22:18,454 --> 00:22:21,290
"Ala? He's disappeared again."

376
00:23:15,611 --> 00:23:18,781
That's why you could return home
without knowing anything.

377
00:23:19,248 --> 00:23:24,420
But when you saw the underwear was missing,
you understood everything.

378
00:23:36,265 --> 00:23:38,066
"Mom..."

379
00:23:39,301 --> 00:23:44,606
You were thinking your mother
had been killed, weren't you?

380
00:24:00,289 --> 00:24:02,357
Shin'ichi, wait.

381
00:24:05,894 --> 00:24:07,663
Look on the back.

382
00:24:20,008 --> 00:24:25,013
Do you know what the message on
the back of this says?

383
00:24:33,956 --> 00:24:36,258
"It was fun."

384
00:24:36,525 --> 00:24:43,398
"When I get better,
we absolutely have to go again. Yukari!"

385
00:24:50,072 --> 00:24:52,274
Mom...

386
00:24:53,408 --> 00:24:58,013
I think your mother didn't give up living...

387
00:24:58,747 --> 00:25:01,617
...because she wanted to be with you.

388
00:25:05,087 --> 00:25:07,289
I'm sorry...

389
00:25:09,391 --> 00:25:11,293
I'm sorry...

390
00:25:11,593 --> 00:25:15,297
Forgive me. Mom, I'm sorry.

391
00:25:32,514 --> 00:25:34,750
What about the Helper, Yamashita-san?

392
00:25:34,950 --> 00:25:38,787
Truth is, he became her Helper
due to the guilt he felt...

393
00:25:38,921 --> 00:25:41,757
...from having caused that traffic accident
when he was still a student.

394
00:25:41,890 --> 00:25:44,593
He isn't connected to this case.

395
00:25:48,397 --> 00:25:50,432
I'll surrender to the police.

396
00:25:55,604 --> 00:25:57,472
"Beika General Hospital"

397
00:26:00,576 --> 00:26:02,044
How did it go?

398
00:26:02,244 --> 00:26:06,081
For now it's attempted murder.

399
00:26:06,248 --> 00:26:08,083
Will you arrest her?

400
00:26:08,250 --> 00:26:11,453
But, isn't this strange?

401
00:26:11,620 --> 00:26:12,854
Well...

402
00:26:12,921 --> 00:26:17,492
After all, her mother returned
to breathing on her own because of it.

403
00:26:18,093 --> 00:26:21,930
"There are things that can't be
understood by modern medicine..."

404
00:26:22,030 --> 00:26:25,200
"...but I'd like to believe this is a miracle."

405
00:26:25,500 --> 00:26:27,970
"Your mother will surely recover."

406
00:26:28,570 --> 00:26:30,806
Thank you very much...

407
00:26:31,340 --> 00:26:32,908
Thank you very much!

408
00:26:33,008 --> 00:26:34,910
Hey!

409
00:26:36,411 --> 00:26:38,246
Weren't you listening?

410
00:26:38,747 --> 00:26:43,752
The point is, switching from being
an underwear thief to a molester is just wrong!

411
00:26:43,852 --> 00:26:47,589
Because of what you've done, strange things
have happened and things got complex and sad...

412
00:26:47,689 --> 00:26:52,327
...and caused a lot of trouble,
so don't you EVER do this again!

413
00:26:52,361 --> 00:26:53,829
I'm sorry.
I won't do it again!

414
00:26:53,929 --> 00:26:55,631
Say, Kudo-kun.

415
00:26:55,731 --> 00:27:00,102
When did you make the connection between
those black panties and the respirator?

416
00:27:00,268 --> 00:27:03,372
That underwear thief had a burn on his hand.

417
00:27:03,472 --> 00:27:06,141
"Um, I'm sorry, this too."

418
00:27:06,808 --> 00:27:08,744
"This is a burn, isn't it?"

419
00:27:09,878 --> 00:27:13,515
As ever, you see the small details,
like black panties.

420
00:27:13,582 --> 00:27:15,517
I guess black is best... That's wrong!

421
00:27:15,617 --> 00:27:17,653
There's no mistaking it, Kudo-kun.
That is your achievement!

422
00:27:17,753 --> 00:27:20,722
You're ganging up on me! You're wrong, I said!

423
00:27:20,789 --> 00:27:23,492
Shin'ichi, let's go.

424
00:27:23,625 --> 00:27:26,662
Yes, yes, all right.

425
00:27:27,562 --> 00:27:32,167
"After this, Yukari-san was sent to
the Prosecutor's office for attempted murder..."

426
00:27:32,401 --> 00:27:35,270
"...but in the end she wasn't prosecuted."

427
00:27:36,371 --> 00:27:40,409
Mom... I'm sorry.

428
00:27:59,528 --> 00:28:03,799
Shin'ichi!
Hurry with the password!

429
00:28:03,965 --> 00:28:07,202
Ah, I've gotten numb.

430
00:28:12,007 --> 00:28:14,142
"Spontaneous Respiration"

431
00:28:19,347 --> 00:28:21,349
"Spontaneous Respiration"

432
00:28:25,954 --> 00:28:27,322
Let's go.

433
00:28:27,489 --> 00:28:28,924
Yes.

434
00:28:33,295 --> 00:28:34,529
Huh?

435
00:28:35,130 --> 00:28:38,100
Ah, a soccer ball!

436
00:28:44,172 --> 00:28:45,207
Huh?

437
00:28:45,307 --> 00:28:46,575
What is it?

438
00:28:46,708 --> 00:28:48,577
This is...

439
00:28:48,810 --> 00:28:50,579
...a bomb?!

440
00:28:55,817 --> 00:29:00,822
"West High School Student Detective,
Hattori Heiji"

441
00:29:03,024 --> 00:29:06,762
"The Great Detective of East and West
Are Challenged in an Impossible Murder Mystery"

442
00:29:06,895 --> 00:29:09,464
"This Drama is Fictional"

